    <!-- Terms & Conditions Page -->
    <item>
        <title>Terms &amp; Conditions</title>
        <link>https://westcoastpawngun.com/terms/</link>
        <dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
        <content:encoded><![CDATA[<h3>Use of This Website</h3>
<p>By accessing this website, you agree to be bound by these terms and conditions. If you do not agree with any part of these terms, you must not use this website.</p>

<h3>Age Requirement</h3>
<p>You must be at least 18 years of age to use this website. By using this website, you represent and warrant that you are at least 18 years old.</p>

<h3>Products and Services</h3>
<p>All firearm purchases are subject to federal, state, and local laws. All buyers must pass a NICS background check and complete ATF Form 4473. We reserve the right to refuse any sale for any reason.</p>

<h3>Pricing</h3>
<p>All prices are subject to change without notice. Sale prices are valid only until the next sales letter is published. We are not responsible for typographical errors in pricing.</p>

<h3>Returns and Refunds</h3>
<p>All sales are final. We do not offer refunds or exchanges on firearms or ammunition. Please inspect your purchase carefully before completing the transaction.</p>

<h3>Layaway Policy</h3>
<p>Layaway requires a 25% non-refundable down payment. Balance must be paid within 4 months. Payments are non-refundable. Items not paid in full within the layaway period will result in forfeiture of all payments made.</p>

<h3>Pawn Loan Terms</h3>
<p>Pawn loan terms, interest rates, and redemption periods are disclosed at the time of the transaction and are subject to Florida state law. Items not redeemed by the due date become property of the store.</p>

<h3>Limitation of Liability</h3>
<p>West Coast Pawn &amp; Gun shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from the use of this website or our services.</p>

<h3>Governing Law</h3>
<p>These terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of Florida.</p>

<h3>Contact</h3>
<p>Questions about these terms should be directed to:<br>
West Coast Pawn &amp; Gun<br>
5619 US Hwy 98 N, Lakeland, FL 33809<br>
(863) 816-5830<br>
westcoastpawn@gmail.com</p>]]></content:encoded>
